<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="description" content="Download YouTube videos as MP3 or MP4 with our YouTube Converter. YTMP3 is free to use and doesn't require any sign-up or subscription."><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title>YTMP3 — Free YouTube to MP3 Converter</title><link rel="canonical" href="https://ytmp3.gl/"><style>body{background-color:#161515;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;margin:0;}input, button{font-family:Arial, sans-serif;}.header{max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;padding-top:24px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;}.header a{color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;margin-right:16px;}.header a:last-child{margin-right:0;}form{background-color:#252525;max-width:600px;border:1px solid #333333;border-radius:8px;margin:32px auto 0 auto;padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;box-sizing:border-box;}form label{color:#9d9d9d;line-height:21px;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;height:21px;display:block;}.form__input{background-color:#191919;height:58px;border:1px solid #3a3a3a;border-radius:6px;padding:6px;display:flex;align-items:center;box-sizing:border-box;}.form__input input, .form__input button{font-size:16px;height:44px;border:none;border-radius:4px;}.form__input input{color:#ffffff;background-color:transparent;flex:1;padding:0 6px;outline:none;}.form__input button{color:#ffffff;background-color:#0085ff;padding:0 24px;cursor:pointer;}.form__format{text-align:center;}.form__format{color:#9d9d9d;}.form__format a{color:#0085ff;}.form__progress{color:#ffffff;gap:12px;justify-content:left;padding:6px 12px;}.form__loader{width:16px;height:16px;border:2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);border-top-color:#ffffff;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;animation:spin 0.8s linear infinite;}.form__error{background-color:transparent;border:none;border-radius:0;gap:12px;justify-content:center;}.form__error button{border-radius:6px;padding:0 12px;}.form__download{background-color:transparent;border:none;border-radius:0;gap:12px;justify-content:center;}.form__download{border-radius:6px;}.form__download button:last-child{color:#9d9d9d;background-color:transparent;border:1px #3a3a3a solid;padding:0 12px;}@keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg);}}.text{color:#9d9d9d;max-width:600px;margin:48px auto 0 auto;}.text h1{color:#ffffff;font-size:24px;font-weight:normal;line-height:24px;margin:0;}.text h2{color:#ffffff;font-size:20px;font-weight:normal;line-height:20px;margin:24px 0 0 0;}.text p{line-height:24px;margin:16px 0 0 0;}.text p.b{font-weight:bold;}.text a{color:#9d9d9d;}.text ol{margin:16px 0 0 0;padding:0;list-style-position:inside;}.text ol li{line-height:24px;margin-bottom:8px;}.text ol li:last-child{margin-bottom:0;}.footer{text-align:center;max-width:600px;border-top:1px #1d1d1d solid;margin:48px auto 0 auto;padding:24px 0;}.footer a{color:#9d9d9d;text-decoration:none;margin:0 8px;}@media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {.header{margin:0 4%;}.header a:nth-of-type(3){display:none;}form{margin:32px 4% 0 4%;padding:16px;}.form__input button{padding:0 12px;}.text{margin:48px 4% 0 4%;}.footer{margin:64px 4% 0 4%;}}</style></head><body><div class="header"><div><img src="/svg/1788164393/logo.svg" width="90" height="44" alt="YTMP3"></div><div><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/faq/">FAQ</a><a href="/add-on/">Add-On</a><a href="/bookmarklet/">Bookmarklet</a></div></div><form autocomplete="off" method="post"><label for="link">Paste your YouTube link</label><div class="form__input"><input id="link" type="text" name="link" placeholder="youtube.com/watch?v=" autofocus required><button type="submit">Convert MP3</button></div><div class="form__format">Or <a href="#" class="mp3">download as MP4 (video)</a></div></form><div class="text"><h1>YouTube to MP3 Converter</h1><p>YTMP3 is an online YouTube to MP3 converter that lets you convert YouTube videos into MP3 or MP4 files and download them for free. The service is completely free and does not require any sign-up or subscription. YTMP3 is optimized to work on any device — all you need is a modern web browser. By using our service, you accept our <a href="/terms-of-use/">Terms of Use</a>.</p><p>How to use YTMP3</p><ol><li>Go to YouTube.com and search for the video you want to download.</li><li>Copy the link of the video and paste it into our converter above.</li><li>Choose a download format. By default, the video will be converted to an MP3 file. To change the format, simply click the &ldquo;Or download as ...&rdquo; link.</li><li>Click the &ldquo;Convert&rdquo; button to start the conversion. Depending on the length of the video and the format you chose, this may take a while. Once the conversion has finished, you can save the file by clicking the &ldquo;Download&rdquo; button.</li></ol><p>Thank you for using our YouTube to MP3 Converter.</p></div><div class="footer"><a href="/contact/">Contact</a><a href="/copyright-claims/">Copyright Claims</a><a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a><a href="/terms-of-use/">ToU</a></div><script src="/js/1788164393/ytmp3.js" defer></script></body></html>